  0cm;margin-left:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;line-height:
  normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>LED
  sinyal etkisini vermektedir.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
