  dotted windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:1.0pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Perakende
  satılacak şekilde set olarak hazırlanmış, bebekler için video gözetleme sistemi
  olarak adlandırılan ürün. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Aşağıdakilerden
  oluşmaktadır:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListParagraphCxSpFirst style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;
  mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;
  mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
  font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>-<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Bir
  mikrofon, video sinyal gönderici, anten ihtiva eden kablosuz TV kamerası, (Kamera
  ses/görüntü çıkış arayüzüne sahiptir)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;
  mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;
  mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
  font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>-<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Yaklaşık
  14cm (5,6 inç) köşegen uzunluğu ve 4:3 en/boy oranına sahip, hoparlör, video sinyal
  alıcı ve anten ihtiva eden ses/görüntü girişi ara yüzü olan kablosuz renkli LCD
  monitör. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListParagraphCxSpMiddle style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;
  mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;
  mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
  font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>-<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>2
  adaptör<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListParagraphCxSpLast style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;
  mso-add-space:auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;
  mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1'><![if !supportLists]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
  font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>-<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Ses/görüntü
  kablosu<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Sinyaller
  kameradan monitöre 2,4 GHz frekansında 150 m menzilde aktarılmaktadır.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>Set,
  bebekleri uzaktan izlemek için kullanılır. <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:
  justify;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=128 valign=top style='width:76.65pt;border-top:none;border-left:
