  "Times New Roman",serif'><span style='mso-list:Ignore'>-<span
  style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>       
  </span></span></span><![endif]><span style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:"Times New Roman",serif'>12
  adet kancalı kauçuk bant <o:p></o:p></span></p>
  <p class=ListParagraphCxSpLast style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:3.4pt;
  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;mso-add-space:
  auto;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
